# Vault (issues · workday · wiki)

Design detail: [vault/README.md](../vault/README.md)

## Goals

- **Practical use** — log dev/repo/skills work only; skip casual chat
- **Separate files** — daily `issues/` · plan `workday/` · knowledge `wiki/pages/`
- **Obsidian** — frontmatter `tags`, topic `#hashtags`, graph color by folder

Do **not** replace `/fix-record` (long RCA after a validated fix).

## Language

| Where | Language |
|-------|----------|
| **Vault files** | Body may be Thai or English · `tags` / `title:` stay **English** (search + graph) |
| **Chat to user** | Follow `bilingual-th-en.mdc` (~60% Thai) |

## Resolve vault root (before every write)

| Step | If true → vault root |
|------|----------------------|
| 1 | Read `<workspace>/.cursor/ai-skills-vault.json` → `issuesRelative` / `wikiRelative` / `workdayRelative` |
| 2 | `<workspace>/.cursor/vault/issues/` exists | workspace via junction |
| 3 | `<workspace>/vault/issues/` | workspace root |
| 4 | Folder contains `ai-skills/` and `scripts/setup-macos-linux.sh` | agent-skills clone |

Create `issues/`, `workday/`, `wiki/pages/`, `wiki/sources/` if missing.

**WORKDAY** → `vault/workday/YYYY-MM-DD.md` only — protocol: `ai-skills/workday-init/reference.md` § Persistence.

**Wiki pages** → **`/wiki-ingest`** only — protocol: `ai-skills/wiki-ingest/reference.md`. Do **not** auto-write wiki every turn.

## When to write — issues (no ask-first)

Write **after** finishing the user reply, **only on work turns** — **not every message**.

| Write | Skip |
|-------|------|
| code, repo, skills, git, SQL, debug, infra, vault, workflow | greetings, chitchat, trivia, weather |
| work-related skill invokes | long post-mortem → `/fix-record` · durable knowledge → `/wiki-ingest` |
| user says **save to vault** / **เก็บลง vault** | |

Do **not** default to logging every question.

## When to write — wiki (skill only)

Do **not** write wiki files from this rule. User invokes **`/wiki-ingest`** when:

- closed insight worth finding again next month
- paper / article / research summary
- export from `/fix-record` when mechanism is reusable
- user says **save to wiki** / **เก็บลง wiki**

See [vault/wiki/README.md](../vault/wiki/README.md).

## Issues file format (daily log only)

Path: `vault/issues/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — create from [templates/template.issue.md](../templates/template.issue.md) if missing.

Each topic = `## N. title` with `#topic` line, `### Question`, `### Answer / status`.

- Increment `N` sequentially that day
- Topics: `vault`, `git`, `skills`, `sql`, `debug`, `research`, `ui`, `api`, `infrastructure`
- **Append only** — do not delete history
- **No secrets**

## Search before debug / git friction

Follow [`ai-skills/vault-recall/reference.md`](../ai-skills/vault-recall/reference.md). Invoke `/vault-recall` when the user wants search only.

## Precedence

- Vault append **once per turn** before the final reply (after main work)
- If the turn does not match Write → **do not write** and **do not** claim “logged to vault”
- If written → one line in chat: `Logged → <path>`
